# Normalize line endings to LF on checkout, on every platform.
# The frontmatter parser tolerates CRLF, but checking out LF removes
# the whole class of line-ending divergence (notably for the Windows
# CI leg, where Git for Windows otherwise defaults to CRLF).
# text=auto leaves git to auto-detect binary files, so the four
# upstream binary assets are untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
